---
---

<section class="border-b border-rule">
  <div class="container grid items-start gap-x-12 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,22rem)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,27rem)]">
    <div class="pt-12 sm:pt-20 pb-12 md:pb-20">
      <p class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[15px] text-mut">
        <span class="mt-[0.55em] w-2 h-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-now" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Zunain Ali Azam. Based in Karachi, open to remote work and relocation.</span>
      </p>

      <!-- Each verb acts out its meaning once on load: ships slides out, scales grows, learns sharpens, ranks climbs -->
      <h1 class="type-hero mt-8 max-w-[15ch]">
        Code that <span class="verb verb-ships">ships</span>, <span class="verb verb-scales">scales</span>,
        <span class="verb verb-learns">learns</span> and <span class="verb verb-ranks">ranks</span>.
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[56ch] text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        I'm a full-stack software engineer. I ship web apps end to end, deploy them to the cloud, train models
        that learn from messy data, and make sure the result ranks in search. Right now that's Estenarh,
        a healthcare platform with 80,000+ users, and Calyndrs, the events platform I founded.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="/projects" class="btn-secondary">See my work</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cut-out portrait, top-aligned with the copy; only its flat-cut bottom edge fades -->
    <img
      src="/portrait.webp"
      alt="Zunain Ali Azam"
      width="760"
      height="695"
      fetchpriority="high"
      class="block w-full max-w-[18rem] md:max-w-none justify-self-center md:justify-self-end mb-12 md:mb-16 md:mt-20 select-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_92%,transparent)]"
    />
  </div>
</section>
